---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy - PROSPERO">
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface pt-32 pb-12">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-8">
			<p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Privacy</p>
			<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg tracking-tight text-sovereign-blue">Cookie Policy</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
				This policy explains which cookies and similar technologies the PROSPERO website uses, why
				they are used, and how you can control them.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated: 31 July 2026</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="bg-surface-container-lowest py-section-padding">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-10 px-8 text-on-surface-variant">
			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">Who manages this website</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					This is the official website of the PROSPERO Horizon Europe project (Grant Agreement No
					101293102). The project consortium is coordinated by Telefónica Innovación Digital S.L.
					Website dissemination and communication activities are coordinated by Fundación IMDEA
					Networks. Details of the participating organisations and their addresses are available on
					the <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4" href="/consortium">Consortium page</a>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">What these technologies are</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					Cookies are small text files stored by your browser. This site also uses local storage, a
					similar browser feature, solely to remember your cookie preference. Optional analytics
					cookies are created only after you give consent.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">Technologies used</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-outline-variant">
					<table class="w-full min-w-[42rem] border-collapse text-left text-sm">
						<thead class="bg-surface-container-low">
							<tr>
								<th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-sovereign-blue">Name</th>
								<th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-sovereign-blue">Provider</th>
								<th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-sovereign-blue">Purpose</th>
								<th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-sovereign-blue">Duration</th>
								<th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-sovereign-blue">Category</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody class="divide-y divide-outline-variant">
							<tr>
								<td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">prospero-cookie-consent</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">PROSPERO (local storage)</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Remembers the visitor’s consent selection.</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">12 months, or until browser data is cleared or the policy version changes</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Strictly necessary</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_ga</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Google Analytics</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Distinguishes visitors for aggregated website statistics.</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Up to 2 years</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Analytics (optional)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">_ga_&lt;container-id&gt;</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Google Analytics</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Maintains session state for aggregated website statistics.</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Up to 2 years</td>
								<td class="px-4 py-3">Analytics (optional)</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6">
					No advertising or personalisation consent is requested, and those Google consent signals
					remain denied. The current Analytics measurement identifier is
					<span class="font-mono">G-F9XZXQ35LK</span>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">Google Analytics</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					If you accept analytics, Google Analytics processes usage information such as visited pages,
					approximate location derived from IP address, device and browser information, and interaction
					timestamps. We use this information to produce aggregated statistics and improve the website.
					The legal basis for optional analytics processing is your consent. Google Analytics is not
					downloaded when consent is absent or rejected.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					Google may process information in countries outside the European Economic Area using its
					applicable transfer safeguards. Learn more in
					<a
						class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4"
						href="https://business.safety.google/privacy/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer"
					>Google’s business privacy information</a>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">Your choices</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					You may accept all optional technologies, reject them, or make an individual selection.
					Refusing analytics does not affect access to the website. You can withdraw or change your
					consent at any time by selecting “Cookie settings” in the footer. Withdrawal applies
					immediately: analytics storage is denied, accessible analytics cookies are removed, and
					Google Analytics will not load on later visits unless you consent again.
				</p>
				<button
					id="cookie-policy-settings-button"
					type="button"
					class="mt-5 min-h-11 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sovereign-blue focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
				>
					Open cookie settings
				</button>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-sovereign-blue">Browser controls and updates</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					You can also delete cookies and local storage through your browser settings. Doing so will
					make the consent panel appear again. We will update this policy and request consent again
					after 12 months, or sooner when a material change introduces a new optional purpose or
					category.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script>
		document.querySelector('#cookie-policy-settings-button')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			window.prosperoConsent?.openPreferences();
		});
	</script>
</Layout>
